sequenceDiagram
    actor Operator
    participant Setup as Vigilo Setup
    participant Target as PostgreSQL Migration Target
    participant DB as Control Database
    participant GitHub as Official GitHub Releases
    participant Host as Evaluator Host
    alt Standalone Rust host
        Operator->>Setup: apply_migrations with verified target identity
        Setup->>Target: Check cluster, database, schema and recovery state
        Setup->>Target: Pin schema and apply pending migrations on the same session
        Operator->>Setup: validate_placements with connection reference names
        Setup->>DB: Validate the control catalog and routes
    else CLI setup
        Operator->>Setup: setup [--evaluators ID | --skip-evaluators]
        Setup->>DB: Apply pending migrations and validate placement
    end
    opt Evaluators enabled
        Setup->>GitHub: Read published release metadata and bounded catalog
        Setup->>Setup: Check library catalog pin and validate the ABI set
        Setup->>DB: Read installed version metadata in one batch
        loop Each evaluator (sequential)
            alt Matching identity already installed
                Setup->>Setup: Skip download and preserve lifecycle state
            else Version absent
                Setup->>GitHub: Stream archive into owned temporary file
                Setup->>Setup: Verify size and SHA-256
                Setup->>Host: Validate portable package, compile, typed-link ABI
                Host-->>Setup: Prepared artifact
                Setup->>Setup: Match prepared artifact to catalog
                Setup->>DB: Insert missing version, retain all existing versions
            end
        end
    end
    Setup-->>Operator: Success or contextual error, completed work retained
